for the deacon; he has the key.","zh":"晨祷刚做完。你若要领圣水，得等执事回来，钥匙在他身上。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Those who come to pray these days ask for longer days and quiet nights. I tell them what the Church teaches: suffering brings us closer to God.","zh":"近来来祷告的人，求的多是白昼长些、夜里平安。我便照教会的教导告诉他们：苦难使人接近神。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The snow on the heights is late melting this year. The sheep still can't get up to the high pasture, so they're on hay.","zh":"山上的雪今年化得晚，羊到现在还上不了高处的草场，只能喂干草。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/vessel/flask/holy_water","id":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.lancewood-shrine.folk1","type":"actor/person/traveler","name":{"en":"Anselm Chalkcroft","zh":"安瑟伦·垩园"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.lancewood-shrine","x":13,"y":14},"facing":"down","props":{"age":35,"household":"altar.lancewood-shrine.h0","purse":4,"favou